pipenv

According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.

However, in cases of ecosystem thrash, you may have to ignore this.

Pipfile.lock

Poetry

Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to include poetry.lock in version control.

This is a personal preference depending on whether you want to track down your dependencies

poetry.lock

pdm

